From: port_ios lavender
Subject: [PATCH 0324] lavender: fast GPU service bring-up, quiet AKS/GPU logs, kernel RAMDisk installer

1. Fast GPU service bring-up (lavgpu >= 30): wait for rootvnode instead of a
   25 s fixed delay and use 10 ms instead of 2000 ms between known-good ladder
   steps so Adreno 512, LavenderGPU and MetalPluginName are ready by ~19 s
   (40+ s before backboardd matches IOAcceleratorES at ~63 s).
2. Optional boot-arg lavinstall=1: if md0 holds a LAVINST1 archive, unpack
   directories and files directly onto the already-mounted read-write HFSX
   root via XNU VFS (vnode_open / vn_rdwr / mkdir1at / sync_internal) before
   the GPU ladder reads its firmware.
3. Gate repetitive SweetKeyStore and LavenderGPU buffer alloc/map IOLog lines
   so SANTONILOG1 is not wrapped by 50k+ Spotlight/SpringBoard sel 17 lines.

diff --git a/bsd/vfs/vfs_syscalls.c b/bsd/vfs/vfs_syscalls.c
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/bsd/vfs/vfs_syscalls.c
+++ b/bsd/vfs/vfs_syscalls.c
@@ -9896,6 +9896,18 @@ mkdirat(proc_t p, struct mkdirat_args *uap, __unused int32_t *retval)
 	return mkdir1at(vfs_context_current(), uap->path, &va, uap->fd,
 	           UIO_USERSPACE);
 }
+
+int lav_kern_mkdir(const char *path, mode_t mode);
+int
+lav_kern_mkdir(const char *path, mode_t mode)
+{
+	struct vnode_attr va;
+
+	VATTR_INIT(&va);
+	VATTR_SET(&va, va_mode, mode & 07777);
+	return mkdir1at(vfs_context_kernel(), CAST_USER_ADDR_T(path), &va,
+	           AT_FDCWD, UIO_SYSSPACE);
+}
 
 static int
 rmdirat_internal(vfs_context_t ctx, int fd, user_addr_t dirpath,
diff --git a/bsd/dev/lavender_gpu.c b/bsd/dev/lavender_gpu.c
index 9d939c4..e5a4b12 100644
--- a/bsd/dev/lavender_gpu.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/lavender_gpu.c
@@ -134,12 +134,14 @@ lav_wait(unsigned ms)
 	thread_block(THREAD_CONTINUE_NULL);
